{"key": "3bd318222ffa7e1e0c9cffc5ed424fbd", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Você tem dois terminais:\n\n- **T1988A (Get Smart):** online, Wi-Fi, sinal bom. Último contato às 22:55.\n- **T1988B (Get Clássica):** **offline**, chip, **sem sinal**. Último contato às 17:55, há cerca de 5 horas.\n\nSe a máquina que não liga é a T1988B, ela está sem sinal e sem conexão.\n\nPropus abrir um chamado técnico para a T1988B, com o motivo \"sem sinal\". **Ele está proposto e aguarda sua confirmação (ação A-fd6a7d59).** Nada foi aberto ainda. Você confirma?\n\nA proposta expira em 15 minutos [policy:capabilities].\n\nSe a máquina que não liga for outra, me diga o ID dela.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4Bceyqe1pszPwDwHvt", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4079, "output_tokens": 270, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-01#0"}
{"key": "62f9938a7f85014ad942f44867a2f75f", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The sources give a clear picture of the Get Smart but only the price for the Get Clássica.\n\n- **Price:** Get Clássica is R$ 79,90/month and Get Smart is R$ 129,90/month [4].\n- **Get Smart:** It's a smart card machine that runs on Android. You can manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu, issue invoices, and exchange messages between kitchen and floor directly on the device [2][5]. It also works as both computer and fiscal printer, so your counter stays cleaner [1]. It can be integrated with your business system [2].\n- **Get Clássica:** The sources don't describe its features, so I can't say how it differs beyond price.\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica features/functions", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4BthPXXHgzYD7k1fhY", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4311, "output_tokens": 243, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
