{"key": "075c9eb92399d01d3d12353a08a9ee87", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart costs more and does more. It's R$ 129,90/month, against R$ 79,90/month for the Get Clássica [prod-ofertas-maquininha-11].\n\n- **Get Smart:** It's a smart card machine that runs on Android. On the device itself you can manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu, issue invoices, and send messages between kitchen and floor [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10][sup-duvidas-get-smart-17]. It also works as a computer and a fiscal printer [sup-duvidas-get-smart-08]. It can be integrated with your business system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10].\n- **Get Clássica:** The sources I found only give its price, not its features, so I can't compare it with the Smart beyond that.\n\nIf you want, I can bring in a human agent to confirm the Clássica's features.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4C7QMyMPiyDZmjXfzb", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3581, "output_tokens": 288, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
